  <string name="help_message">Before using this app, you need to set up your LED controller:\n\n• WLED: Configure WLED firmware on your ESP8266/ESP32 device\n• Adalight: Connect Arduino with Adalight firmware via USB\n• Hyperion: Install and configure Hyperion server\n\nFor detailed setup instructions, please visit the GitHub repository.</string>
